{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51949","headline":"印山亭即事 · 吕岩","name":"印山亭即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁道凭虚不可楼，波心一点注中流。\n鱼游过影知空相，人到惊云动远眸。\n隔断红尘飞不到，回旋青气望来收。\n江天寂寞难穷目，烟火渔灯乱客愁。\n（同上一四二八《平乐府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}